  "contentHtml": "<p>저번에는 계획서만 올려드렸어서 이번에 2017년도에 사용하였던 과학수사반 자료를 올립니다.</p><p>제가 과학수사에 관심이 많아서 수업용으로 과학수사 관련 책도 3권정도 사서</p><p>실험 키트를 사서 1시간은 이론수업, 1시간은 실험수업으로 진행하였습니다.</p><p>실험을 먼저 하면 좋을 수업은 실험을 한 뒤 생각해보는 시간을 가졌습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/520351d77f24eca9735a2957a46380a822a5f03f?download\" data-file-name=\"자유학기제 활동지1(교사용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"329728\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D233%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20210113102655&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F520351d77f24eca9735a2957a46380a822a5f03f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">자유학기제 활동지1(교사용)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">322.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c965b071d45c24d3e07658c09415deb8963ab374?download\" data-file-name=\"자유학기제 활동지2(교사용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"612352\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D233%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20210113102655&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc965b071d45c24d3e07658c09415deb8963ab374')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">자유학기제 활동지2(교사용)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">598.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/952960a1c2003580bf2d39d7080c404986cd5c27?download\" data-file-name=\"자유학기제 활동지3(교사용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"646144\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%2